WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.580
Mother: Okay, everyone. Listen to me, please.

2
00:00:09.581 --> 00:00:12.513
I've made a dog-care schedule. Rachel:

3
00:00:12.514 --> 00:00:15.694
A dog-care schedule?

4
00:00:15.695 --> 00:00:19.941
Mother: It tells us who feeds and walks the dog.

5
00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:25.814
Ricky: Shhh! Bingo, this is about you.

6
00:00:25.815 --> 00:00:28.780
Mother: Ricky will feed Bingo in the morning.

7
00:00:28.781 --> 00:00:31.705
And Rachel will do it at night.

8
00:00:31.706 --> 00:00:33.870
Ricky & Rachel: Okay, Mom.

9
00:00:33.871 --> 00:00:38.759
Mother: Monday to Friday, Ricky will walk Bingo in the evenings.

10
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.942
On the weekends, your father or I will do it.

11
00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:45.881
Rachel: I want to walk the dog too.

12
00:00:45.882 --> 00:00:47.923
Father: I'm sorry, Rachel.

13
00:00:47.924 --> 00:00:51.620
You are too young, but you can help your brother.

14
00:00:51.621 --> 00:00:54.150
Ricky: I don't need any help!

15
00:00:54.151 --> 00:00:56.787
Father: Ricky, be nice to your sister.

16
00:00:56.788 --> 00:00:59.451
She wants to walk Bingo too. Ricky:

17
00:00:59.452 --> 00:01:02.602
Yes, Dad. She can help. Mother:

18
00:01:02.603 --> 00:01:05.896
Why don't you take the dog for a walk now?

19
00:01:05.897 --> 00:01:07.658
Ricky: Okay, Mom.

20
00:01:07.659 --> 00:01:13.067
Rachel: Me too, me too!

21
00:01:13.068 --> 00:01:16.872
Ricky: Rachel, throw this ball as far as you can.

22
00:01:16.873 --> 00:01:26.869
Bingo and I are going to have a race.

23
00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:33.063
Rachel: Yeah! Bingo won! Bingo won!

